&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Zone 3:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;All other US locations - &lt;/em&gt;$&lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;116,000 - $159,500&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;**&lt;/li&gt;
