&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading complex, cross-functional initiatives from ambiguity to structured systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
