&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ua1xn1&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Clinical Manager (RN) – Home Care&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;38&quot; data-end=&quot;264&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is seeking a Registered Nurse (RN) to join our Bethlehem, PA office as a Clinical Manager. This office provides exceptional in-home care services to adult clients throughout the community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;620&quot;&gt;If you are a skilled nurse looking to transition into a leadership role or advance your management career, this is an excellent opportunity to make a meaningful impact while supporting both clients and clinical staff. As a Clinical Manager, you will help ensure the delivery of high-quality care while mentoring and developing a team of dedicated nurses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;hz5foi&quot; data-start=&quot;622&quot; data-end=&quot;658&quot;&gt;As a Clinical Manager, you will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5jlvrh&quot; data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;741&quot;&gt;Lead, inspire, and support clinical staff in delivering exceptional patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11wsuoc&quot; data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;Conduct client assessments and supervisory visits in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x6e70h&quot; data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;875&quot;&gt;Develop individualized care plans and oversee their implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1htau83&quot; data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;Supervise and mentor nursing staff to ensure quality, compliance, and positive patient outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l64qo3&quot; data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;Facilitate new hire orientation and onboarding activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a27wyr&quot; data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;Participate in the training and development of new nurses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t4gvea&quot; data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Coordinate and provide ongoing education and in-service training for field staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1khycxb&quot; data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;Collaborate with office leadership to support operational and clinical goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1obkcim&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1egfeho&quot; data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1324&quot;&gt;Active Registered Nurse (RN) license required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hls6zh&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1376&quot;&gt;Minimum of 2 years of nursing experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vbj34u&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Experience working with adult clients required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c877bq&quot; data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Previous home care or home health experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a0hajs&quot; data-start=&quot;1483&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;Prior supervisory or leadership experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hvmt57&quot; data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Strong clinical, organizational, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xsoxaf&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;Reliable transportation required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;n4qdxf&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;What BAYADA Offers:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1msf13i&quot; data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation paid weekly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ysxbpo&quot; data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Monday–Friday schedule supporting work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ns7pfk&quot; data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;2000&quot;&gt;Comprehensive benefits package, including:
